OL,3,GNEWSAPC accused of sex offences charged
OL,4,Awith misconduct
OL,5,
OL,6,FA serving police officer charged with
OL,7,Fchild sex offences has now also been
OL,8,Fcharged with misconduct in a public
OL,9,Foffice.
OL,11,FHaydyn Brunsdon, a constable with
OL,12,FDurham Constabulary, appeared at Newton
OL,13,FAycliffe Magistrates' Court earlier
OL,14,Fwhere he did not enter any pleas.
OL,16,FThe 31-year-old was charged with two
OL,17,Fattempts of sexual communication with a
OL,18,Fchild and one count of misconduct in a
OL,19,Fpublic office, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
