OL,3,GNEWSAPC accused of sex offences charged
OL,4,Awith misconduct
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was released on bail to appear
OL,7,Fbefore Durham Crown Court later this
OL,8,Fmonth. Brunsdon remains suspended from
OL,9,Fduty while an investigation is carried
OL,10,Fout by the force's Professional
OL,11,FStandards Department.
